HCJYBKAI"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwj6oP7_xdKWAxXsVPUHHa31LAoQ3IcHCJMBKBI",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["250722-醬油豚骨拉麵\n20:25入店，僅有我一位客人，20:32上餐，很快速。\n因為很喜歡吃筍乾所以有額外點一盤。\n第一次來，所以點了最基本的醬油豚骨拉麵，湯頭是屬於較濃郁的豚骨拉麵，不過是可以想像的味道，沒有驚豔但不錯。\n來談配置，豚叉燒4片、筍乾數根、碎洋蔥、蔥花、溏心蛋1顆，整體最喜歡的還是筍乾。很高興自己還有另外加點筍乾，真的不錯，鰹魚味很明顯，筍乾這個數量跟價格，算是很便宜又很多，之後來應該都會加點，\n麵條無功無過。\n整體而言，如果開在我家附近，突然很想吃拉麵可能會去吃，下次來會想換雞骨清湯試試看。",null,[0,60]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5053903896876097459/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjE0Y0UxRlVqSldiR3N4VkVoT2FWWXhaM2xpYmtwTlVsWk9WRmxWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5053903896876097459/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjE0Y0UxRlVqSldiR3N4VkVoT2FWWXhaM2xpYmtwTlVsWk9WRmxWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5053903896876097459/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjE0Y0UxRlVqSldiR3N4VkVoT2FWWXhaM2xpYmtwTlVsWk9WRmxWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5053903896876097459/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjE0Y0UxRlVqSldiR3N4VkVoT2FWWXhaM2xpYmtwTlVsWk9WRmxWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5053903896876097459/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjE0Y0UxRlVqSldiR3N4VkVoT2FWWXhaM2xpYmtwTlVsWk9WRmxWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5053903896876097459/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjE0Y0UxRlVqSldiR3N4VkVoT2FWWXhaM2xpYmtwTlVsWk9WRmxWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,14837,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214cE1FUjJWbGsxVEhOaVYxZ3libkpNUlZOVFlVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1c5271169bb88664!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmxpMER2Vlk1THNiV1gybnJMRVNTYUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214cE1FUjJWbGsxVEhOaVYxZ3libkpNUl